# Binary deliverables are never converted. A line-ending conversion inside a PDF
# shifts its internal offsets and damages the file on a Windows clone.
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.docx binary

# The dashboards are written by the pipeline. GitHub leaves generated files out
# of its language statistics.
reports/*/dashboard.html linguist-generated
